- MBO+ or Bachelor's level working and thinking ability;
- Proven experience in purchasing activities, such as placing orders, communicating with suppliers, and monitoring delivery schedules;
- Good command of the English language, both spoken and written;
- Experience with administrative processes and digital systems (experience with ERP systems is an advantage);
- A structured and detail-oriented way of working;
- A proactive mindset and the perseverance to find solutions when challenges arise;
